trivial|[trivial] Run a spell checker over docs and comments|`.github/workflows/ci.yml`, `docs/`, `README.md`|Typos in public docs are common and cheap to catch automatically.|Add a `typos` or equivalent CI step over tracked text files;Add a project dictionary for domain terms such as Soroban, stroop and SEP-41;Fail the job on findings rather than only printing them|Keep the configuration in the repository so local runs match CI
